# `use js` members checked by lib/web.webidl when compiled (card js-webidl-bindings, notes/js_globals.md); the calls
# themselves run in the playground (test_web_idl.pairs.warp, the browser tour)
'use js URL; u = URL("https://a.b/c"); u.pathnam'	error	URL has no pathnam
'use js crypto; crypto.randomUUD()'	error	the global crypto is a Crypto
'use js document; document.body.innerHTM'	error	through the parents: HTMLElement, Element
'use js console; console.lgo("x")'	error	a namespace's members
